description:
Implement an authentication context. Export `AuthProvider` and `useAuth()` returning `{ user, login, logout }`. `user` is `null` initially; `login(username: string)` sets the user; `logout()` clears it.

**Example:**
```tsx
function App() {
  return (
    <AuthProvider>
      <Profile />
    </AuthProvider>
  );
}

function Profile() {
  const { user, login, logout } = useAuth();
  return user ? <button onClick={logout}>{user}</button> : <button onClick={() => login('alice')}>Sign in</button>;
}
```

